  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Antimicrobal stewardship and conservancy in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is human capital and research development in a global priority: the optimal management of infections in the context of antimicrobial stewardship and conservancy. The project is designed to improve key infection-related health statsitics in Malawi and Mozambique by conducting research and generating evidence on the nature and extent of AMR with a view to designing context specific interventions for its containment.</narrative>
  </description>
